_bonus\" title=\"Profane bonus\">Profane bonus</a> to Hit Points.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 15</a>:</b> This item provides a +15 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to your Acid, Cold, Fire, and Electrical resistances.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Quality Constitution +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Quality Constitution +3</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Natural_armor_bonus\" title=\"Natural armor bonus\">Natural Armor +14</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_